      "comment": "Judge error. It says the 1860 census entry claims \"includes your 1861–1865\", but in the agent's return that entry reads only \"Undated collection.\" The \"includes your 1861–1865\" line belongs to the Muster Rolls entry above it (1860–1869, which does include the searched years). Every other coverage line is right (GAR overlaps in 1865, IRS Tax Lists overlap in 1862–1865), and all six links and access values match the tool output."
